NOTE ON DATA AND THIRD-PARTY CODE

This license covers the code in this repository only. The repository contains
NO market data. Reproducing the results requires a WRDS subscription with
access to CRSP, Compustat, and IBES; that data is licensed by its vendors and
may not be redistributed. Factor definitions follow the Open Source Asset
Pricing project (Chen & Zimmermann, 2022; openassetpricing.com), whose code
and data are licensed separately by their authors and are not included here.
